==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*lewbʰ-|id=love}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*ľubiti}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*lewbʰ-}}, whence {{cog|en|love}}, {{cog|sa|लुभ्यति||to desire}}, {{cog|sa|लोभयति||to make crazy}} and {{cog|la|libet}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|люби́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-любить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|люби́ть|impf|pf=полюби́ть|vn=люби́мец<q:nomen patientis>,люби́тель<q:nomen agentis>}}

# to [[love]], to [[like]], to be [[fond]] of, to grow fond of {{q|more intensely than {{m|ru|нра́виться}}}}

